<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/font-families.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/index.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/css/all.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/Notification-Dialog/styles/notification-dialog-styles.css">
    <script defer src="css/Notification-Dialog/functions/notification-dialog-functions.js"></script>
    <script defer src="js/start.js"></script>
    <title>Start QUIZ</title>
</head>
<body>
    <p class="id-selection-heading">Start QUIZ</p>
    <p>Read the following instructions carefully before you start the quiz.</p>
    <ol class="instructions">
        <li>Turn off all external notifications on your device before starting the quiz.</li>
        <li>Enter the unique ID that you were given for the quiz and click the 'Start Quiz' button.</li>
        <li>Do not leave the questions page, switch to other tabs, or minimize the browser.</li>
        <li>Click the 'Submit' button at the bottom of the page when you finish answering the questions.</li>
        <li>After the submission, click the 'Download Result' button to see your performance.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Please note that your quiz is timed. Your responses will be submitted automatically when the timer runs.</p>
    <div class="id-selection-section">
        <div>
        </div>
        <form id="form" action="/questions" method="post">
            <div>
                <label class="normal-text" for="user-id-field">Your quiz ID:</label><br>
                <input id="user-id-field" name="quizID" type="text" placeholder="Type in your ID in here...">
            </div>
            <button>Start Quiz</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>